      <h1>Our home ground</h1>
      <p>
        Honest Acres Group focuses on the Cross Timbers and the North Hill
        Country — neighbors, but not the same country, and knowing the
        difference is worth real money whether you're buying or selling. For
        buyers, we also work the Brazos region, the river country we
        advertise on Land.com and LandWatch.
      </p>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>The Cross Timbers</h3>
          <p>Post oak and blackjack oak over sandy loam — cattle pasture, Bermuda hay fields, tanks and creeks, and outstanding deer and turkey country.</p>
          <p><a href="/regions/cross-timbers/">Cross Timbers guide →</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>The North Hill Country</h3>
          <p>Limestone hills, live oak, and clear-running water at the northern edge of the Hill Country — ranch and recreational land with elevation and views.</p>
          <p><a href="/regions/north-hill-country/">North Hill Country guide →</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>The Brazos Region</h3>
          <p>Brazos River bottoms, pecan groves, cattle and hay country, and lake access — the region we advertise for buyers on Land.com and LandWatch.</p>
          <p><a href="/regions/brazos/">Brazos region guide →</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:1rem;">Shopping by county instead? <a href="/county-guides/">See the county guides →</a></p>
